    <h2 id="juyongguan" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🏯 居庸关：北京周边最适合半日游的一段？</h2>

    <img
      src="/images/great-wall/juyongguan.webp"
      alt="居庸关的关城城楼，绿瓦屋顶，身后长城沿山脊蜿蜒"
      width="530"
